  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "deal-with-phrv",
      "handle-v",
      "cope-v"
    ],
    "note": "Use **deal with** for a problem or a task you act on (*deal with a complaint*). **Handle** is close and often praises the skill (*She handles difficult customers well*). **Cope** is about managing to go on when life is hard, often with no object (*I can't cope anymore*)."
  },
